        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transistor, unspecified, at plant
This module represents an unweighted average of all specific transistor datasets represented in the ecoinvent database.; UUID: 13a6dba9-e6bd-3cba-b793-209c64f1e5c9
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of current transistors.
Location: Data represent global valuable composition data for transistors.
Technology: average production technology comprising Si-crystal die bonding; wire bonding; encapsulation; plating; triming; forming and marking.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see Geography and General Comments
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_13a6dba9-e6bd-3cba-b793-209c64f1e5c9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
